function productCloseInfo(p){const raw=p?.closeDate||p?.deadline||p?.orderCloseDate||'';if(!raw){if(p?.isLongTerm||/長期/.test(String(p?.type||'')+' '+String(p?.tags||'')))return{kind:'long',label:'長期接單',date:'',days:null};if(/現貨|直購/.test(String(p?.type||'')))return{kind:'stock',label:'現貨商品',date:'',days:null};return{kind:'pending',label:'結單日待公布',date:'',days:null}}let d;if(/^\d{4}-\d{1,2}-\d{1,2}$/.test(String(raw)))d=new Date(String(raw)+'T23:59:59');else d=new Date(raw);if(isNaN(d))return{kind:'pending',label:'結單日待公布',date:String(raw),days:null};const end=new Date(d.getFullYear(),d.getMonth(),d.getDate(),23,59,59,999),now=new Date(),today=new Date(now.getFullYear(),now.getMonth(),now.getDate()),target=new Date(end.getFullYear(),end.getMonth(),end.getDate()),days=Math.round((target-today)/864e5),md=String(end.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')+'/'+String(end.getDate()).padStart(2,'0'),wd='日一二三四五六'[end.getDay()];if(p?.isClosed||days<0)return{kind:'closed',label:'已結單',date:md+'（'+wd+'）',days};if(days===0)return{kind:'today',label:'今日結單',date:md+'（'+wd+'）',days};if(days===1)return{kind:'urgent',label:'明日結單',date:md+'（'+wd+'）',days};if(days<=3)return{kind:'urgent',label:'剩 '+days+' 天',date:md+'（'+wd+'）',days};if(days<=14)return{kind:'soon',label:'剩 '+days+' 天',date:md+'（'+wd+'）',days};return{kind:'normal',label:'結單日',date:md+'（'+wd+'）',days}}
